From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oliver Gassner <42lizard@42lizard.dev>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 18:47:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: dt-bindings: qcom,sm8250: Add Dell XPS 13 9345
 sound card

Document the Dell-specific compatible selecting the reversed speaker
channel wiring, as proposed in Abel Vesa's October 2025 RFC.

Link: https://lkml.iu.edu/hypermail/linux/kernel/2510.2/09945.html
Signed-off-by: Oliver Gassner <42lizard@42lizard.dev>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml
index 1536fcd..eccafdf 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml
@@ -34,6 +34,7 @@ properties:
           - const: qcom,sm8450-sndcard
       - enum:
           - ayaneo,pocket-s2-sndcard
+          - dell,xps13-9345-sndcard
           - fairphone,fp4-sndcard
           - fairphone,fp5-sndcard
           - qcom,apq8096-sndcard
-- 
2.56.0


